# npm packing rules for octie/.
# When this file exists, npm ignores .gitignore for packing.
# Mirrors .gitignore EXCEPT dist/web-ui/: the built web UI bundle MUST
# ship in the tarball because `octie serve` serves it from dist/web-ui,
# and releases are packed from the repo root (files: ["octie"]) where
# .gitignore's `dist/web-ui/` exclusion would otherwise drop it.
# See octie-serve-webui-bug-report.md.
node_modules/
dist/**/*.map
build/
*.log
.octie/
*.octie
tasks.json
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
coverage/
.nyc_output/
html/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
